{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『GREEN GORA』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだゴルフ始めたばっかりの新入部員ですが\n載せていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織とひめたんと＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ4記事連続で\n伊織と同じお仕事の告知をしてますね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"予告しておくとこのブログでは\nひめたんと同じお仕事の話ばっかりになってますけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドラコン対決してきたよ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が一番飛ばしたか予想する\nサイン色紙やサイン入り楽天ボールのプレゼント企画もやってるよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://gora.golf.rakuten.co.jp/greengora/campaign/nogiten/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽天SHOWTIMEで乃木坂ゴルフ倶楽部を\nもう１回見直して\n予想するのも楽しそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また貼っとくね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉw\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/156933/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴルフウェア可愛すぎてやばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たっぷり載せていただいたから\nポニテ中田見てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日サンエトで撮影してきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「Men's JOKER WATCH」の\n「SJ WATCH」 という特集に出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれに撮っていただけて\n本当に楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売日近くになったらまたお知らせしますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、\nサンエトファンの皆さんにもう１つ朗報です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29日にまたサンエトが\nらじらー！SUNDAY に出させて頂けることが決まりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回、ユニット名をみなさんから募集して\n『サンクエトワール』に決めさせていただいたんですけど\n今回はキャッチフレーズ募集します＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://www.nhk.or.jp/radirer/sunday/basic_sun09.html"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に全部読んで選んでるので\nみなさんからのキャッチフレーズ\n楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/16/7793325/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回たくさんのご応募いただいたけど\nまだまだ読めるのでお願いしますね` ･ω･ ´にやり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}